<BaseLayout title="AI Tools for Designers (2026): The Complete Stack" description="A complete guide to AI tools for designers in 2026. The 8 tools every designer needs, the 5 workflows, the 3 use cases, and the 3 things to avoid." keywords="AI tools for designers, design AI, AI design stack, AI image generation, AI for design">
